16	 * {@code VIC 3000-3099}, {@code QLD 4000-4099}, else {@code UNKNOWN}) and HASH8 is the first 8
17	 * upper-case hex characters of {@code SHA-256} over the owner's normalized telephone concatenated
18	 * with its last name (e.g. {@code NSW-1A2B3C4D}).
